ong at church.','The whole place!',1,NULL,'2023-04-01','16:00:00',NULL,'08:00:00',NULL,20,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,6673,3,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0),('Potluck!!! Please bring something to share!','','',1,NULL,'2023-05-07','11:00:00',NULL,'11:30:00',NULL,21,NULL,NULL,'','More information',1,1,6674,2,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0),('Congregational Meeting','','',1,NULL,'2023-05-07','11:30:00',NULL,'12:30:00',NULL,22,NULL,NULL,'','More information',1,1,6675,1,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0),('Board of Trustees','','',1,NULL,'2023-06-21','18:30:00',NULL,'20:00:00',NULL,23,NULL,NULL,'','More information',1,1,6676,1,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0),('Emerson Community Writing Group','The Emerson Community Writing Group is meeting after the service this Sunday 18th, so have your writing tools, notebooks or journals and gather around Karyl Howard afterthe service. If you have children present, please have some activity for them to do while we meet. For more information, contact Karyl Howard.','',1,NULL,'2023-06-18','11:00:00',NULL,'12:00:00',NULL,24,NULL,NULL,'','More information',1,1,6677,1,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0),('St. Charles Pride','Emerson will once again host a booth at St Charles Pride at the Family Arena on Saturday, June 17, 2023 from 12:00 pm-7:00 pm. This is a prime opportunity to introduce Emerson to community members who don’t know what we’re about and want to find out more. We typically have a raffle, a give-away for kids, and pamphlets to share with adults. We need at least 10 people to help on the day of the event and 5-6 to support the planning beforehand. We will need to make sure we have some good decorations for the booth and we are ready with our informational pamphlets and giveaways. For more information and to volunteer, please contact Nancy Fish.','Family Arena',1,NULL,'2023-06-17','12:00:00',NULL,'19:00:00',NULL,25,NULL,NULL,'','More information',1,1,6678,1,NULL,'s',NULL,'calendar',0);
